          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 13714,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1697910845,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Totally get it, @johnthacker -- my old address from commit history is from CVS and SVN times, I imagined it was migrated to GIT history.\nIn either case, I do appreciate your support on this, and Happy Holidays!\nCarlos.",
